// Phase 5 recipes (crafting-full 4.3, 4.5, 4.9): smithing with heat, forge, quench and temper; repair, refit, salvage and reforge; carpentry and vehicle parts; building
// materials, leather and cloth; field-kit work. Historical labour times (a sword is days of a smith's work, mail weeks), allowed at 8x in safety. Charcoal is the fuel of
// the heat and forge steps (1 kg a heat-hour); the heat step is the cold start (30 min) and is left out when the forge is already hot. Every recipe passes the mass check.
